| kotlin-f32 | `java -cp reference/kotlin-f32/build/{library,tests}.jar TestMainKt` | 1 | 730 | 1 | **fail** |
| rust-f32 | `reference/rust-f32/gen/target/debug/deps/boring_codec_f32_gen-519654b8cf35cf62 finite_classification` | (panic) | 730 个测试 | 1 | **FAILED** |
